  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Kepler-22b** (2 other sources): Lyrics for this track were altered to include the phrase dancin is good for ya; The band changed the lyrics of this song to say dancin is good for ya [1][2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **02 Killer Year**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Dreams**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Kepler-22b**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-11-02** (recommended): source not stated; 8 songs; 135 min [1]\n- **kglw2025-11-02.SBD**: soundboard; 0 songs; 135 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The song Dreams made its first live appearance at this specific concert [1]\n- Dreams was performed for the first time during this particular London gig [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-11-02**: taped by Tora Tapes; transferred by Tora Tapes; source: FOB > Zoom F3 + Røde M5 > WAV > Audacity > WAV [1]\n- **kglw2025-11-02.SBD**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joseph Santarpia, Gaspard De Mulemeester, Grace Reader and Brandon DeLapp; source: SBD [2]. Also: Soundboard recording handled by band sound crew members including Sam Joseph [2]",
